  "title": "Predict. Perform. Prove.",
  "summary": "Guidewire’s approach is to work with customers to deliver analytics in a meaningful way (i.e., at exactly the right moment when they can be valuable to an underwriter or a claims adjuster and do that at a large scale). Guidewire facilitates millions of daily transactions across claims, policies, and billing. We seek to improve the efficiency of each transaction so that we can provide significant value for policyholders and claimants, for the industry, and for the world.",
